# rustic

**Authority:** [rustic user documentation](https://rustic.cli.rs/docs). Verify every key against [configuration file](https://rustic.cli.rs/docs/commands/init/configuration_file.html) and in-repo [config/full.toml](https://github.com/rustic-rs/rustic/blob/main/config/full.toml) before changing profiles.

| Topic | Doc |
|-------|-----|
| GDrive (OpenDAL) | [Supported services](https://rustic.cli.rs/docs/commands/init/services.html), [Gdrive](https://opendal.apache.org/docs/rust/opendal/services/struct.Gdrive.html), [gdrive.toml](https://github.com/rustic-rs/rustic/blob/main/config/services/gdrive.toml) |
